    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smyth Naas welcome you to 6 Ornamental Gardens - a luxury first floor two bedroom duplex apartment presented in good condition throughout. This fine property boasts spacious and light filled interiors which would be ideal for someone downsizing from a larger home. The apartment is available for immediate sale and occupation.\r\n\r\nOldtown Demesne is situated within a twenty minute walk of the main street of Naas. The Arrow train station is a similar distance. All amenities including shops, shopping centres, pubs, restaurants, churches, schools, sports clubs, cinemas, banks and parks are close at hand. Country walks can be enjoyed along the banks of the Grand Canal. The Kerry Global Centre is a five minute drive. The N7 will take you to the M50 in fifteen minutes.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to 97 square comprising entrance hallway, lounge, kitchen, two double bedrooms (both en-suite and main with walk-in wardrobe) and guest wc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\n1.23m x 1.55m (4' 0\" x 5' 1\")\r\n1.77m x 2.85m (5' 10\" x 9' 4\")\r\nSolid oak flooring. Recess lighting.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\n1.50m x 1.01m (4' 11\" x 3' 4\")\r\nWith wc and wash hand basin. Half tiled. Tiled floor. Heated towel rack.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\n4.20m x 5.28m (13' 9\" x 17' 4\")\r\nSolid oak flooring. Feature stone open fireplace with cast iron inset. Bay window. Recess lighting. Tv point. Decorative coving and centre rose.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n2.31m x 3.14m (7' 7\" x 10' 4\")\r\nWall and base fitted units. Large area of granite worktop space and splashback. Integrated Whirlpool electric hob, oven and dishwasher. Chrome extractor. Plumbed for washing machine. Fitted shelving. Breakfast bar. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n1.12m x 2.45m (3' 8\" x 8' 0\")\r\n1.79m x 3.05m (5' 10\" x 10' 0\")\r\nHotpress.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n4.21m x 5.28m (13' 10\" x 17' 4\")\r\nWall to wall fitted wardrobes and vanity unit. Recess lighting.\r\n\r\nWalk in Wardrobe\r\n1.53m x 2.25m (5' 0\" x 7' 5\")\r\nBespoke storage areas.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n2.13m x 1.68m (7' 0\" x 5' 6\")\r\nFully tiled with white wc, wash hand basin with storage and double shower with screen. Shaver light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n4.29m x 3.42m (14' 1\" x 11' 3\")\r\nDouble fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n1.63m x 2.76m (5' 4\" x 9' 1\")\r\nFully wiled with white wc, wash hand basin with storage and bath. Telephone shower. Heated towel rack.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nCommunal gardens. Designated car parking space with ample visitor spaces."
      },
      {
